OData.CompetencyContent" sap:label="Competency Content" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>CompetencyContent</Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Suite (STE)</sap:tag><sap:tag>STE - Skills Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="CandidateProfileExtension" EntityType="SFOData.CandidateProfileExtension" sap:label="Candidate Profile Extension" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Candidate Profile Extension</Summary><LongDescription>The candidate profile extension entity allows a user to query, insert and update data related to a candidate. This information is exposed to recruiting operators, and will be exposed to candidates in the future. The candidate profile extension entity contains additional candidate profile data consisting of custom defined fields. The majority of fields might be custom fields – depending on the configuration of that MDF object. The MDF object appears in the Candidate Profile User Interface for recruiting operators (and in the future will be available to candidates).</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Candidate</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="ExternalTimeData" EntityType="SFOData.ExternalTimeData" sap:label="External Time Data" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>ExternalTimeData</Summary><LongDescription>External Time Data contains time data from external systems.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payroll Time Sheets</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="TimeTypeDEU" EntityType="SFOData.TimeTypeDEU" sap:label="Time Type (DEU)" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>TimeTypeDEU</Summary><LongDescription>Contains the time type DEU definition.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="AllowanceRecording" EntityType="SFOData.AllowanceRecording" sap:label="Allowance Recording" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>AllowanceRecording</Summary><LongDescription>The entity represents an allowance record for an employee.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Payroll Time Sheets</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="EmployeeTimeMEX" EntityType="SFOData.EmployeeTimeMEX" sap:label="Employee Time (MEX)" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>EmployeeTimeMEX</Summary><LongDescription>Contains information related to attendance times of hourly and salaried employees. For Mexico (MEX) specific fields.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="CustomNav" EntityType="SFOData.CustomNav" sap:label="CustomNav" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription>NOT PUBLIC</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Foundation/Platform (PLT)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PLT - Custom Navigation</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PerEmergencyContacts" EntityType="SFOData.PerEmergencyContacts" sap:label="Primary Emergency Contact" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>PerEmergencyContacts</Summary><LongDescript