e dated recurring compensation history for an employee such as salary and recurring bonuses. This is useful reading all compensation changes over a period of time.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Compensation Information</sap:tag><sap:tag>Recommended</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Holiday" EntityType="SFOData.Holiday" sap:label="Holiday" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Holiday</Summary><LongDescription>This is a Holiday object that you can use to create holidays for inclusion in a holiday calendar. Holidays can be country-specific- for example, July 4 as Independence Day in the United States.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="SkillEntity" EntityType="SFOData.SkillEntity" sap:label="Skill" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>SkillEntity</Summary><LongDescription>This entity is a basic library that is used to describe skills are acquired through training. They are mapped to a job role or job family.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Suite (STE)</sap:tag><sap:tag>STE - Skills Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="ONB2Process" EntityType="SFOData.ONB2Process" sap:label="Process" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription>ONB2Process</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Onboarding (ONB)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="WorkflowAllowedActionList" EntityType="SFOData.WorkflowAllowedActionList" sap:label="WorkflowAllowedActionList" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="